To use OpenSSL in C++, you will first need to make sure you have installed the OpenSSL development libraries on your system. Install the OpenSSL library, which is typically available via package managers like `apt` on Ubuntu or `brew` on Mac. Here's an example on how to install OpenSSL on Ubuntu:

```bash
